WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.880
Now, as a total contrast to what Donald&nbsp;
Trump was doing on Twitter yesterday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:10.080
Joe Biden gave a speech as votes continue to be&nbsp;
counted as Donald Trump was imploding on Twitter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.080
claiming states for himself that&nbsp;
hadn't been called demanding votes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.960
not be counted in certain states and be counted&nbsp;
in other states depending on where they are.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:25.600
Joe Biden gave an actual presidential speech,&nbsp;
which was completely normal and boring in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.240
Wilmington, Delaware. But as a contrast&nbsp;
to what we've seen for the last four years&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:37.280
actually was surprising in that it reduced the&nbsp;
temperature. It did not call for people to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:42.080
claims that couldn't yet be backed up. It&nbsp;
united people. Just take a look at this.&nbsp;

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.800
It'll be time for us to do what we've always&nbsp;
done as Americans. To put the harsh rhetoric&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:55.040
of the campaign behind us, to lower the&nbsp;
temperature. To see each other again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:06.400
to listen to one another twist, to hear each other&nbsp;
again, respect and care for one another. To unite,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:16.000
to heal, to come together as a nation. I know this&nbsp;
won't be easy. I'm not naive, neither of us are.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:19.840
I know how deep and hard the opposing views are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:26.080
in our country on so many things,&nbsp;
but I also know this as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:33.360
To make progress, we have to stop treating&nbsp;
our opponents as enemies. We are not enemies.&nbsp;

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:40.800
What brings us together as Americans is so much&nbsp;
stronger than anything that can tear us apart,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:47.440
and importantly, during this speech, Joe&nbsp;
Biden also pointed out he believes he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:54.480
on the path to 270. At the time, he believed it.&nbsp;
He says in the speech, I'm not declaring victory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:59.760
and then issues this message of coming together.
Very important moment where he says this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:08.320
now after a long night of counting. It's clear&nbsp;
that we're winning enough states to reach 270&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:13.280
electoral votes needed to win the presidency.&nbsp;
I'm not here to declare that we've won,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:20.880
but I am here to report when the count is&nbsp;
finished, we believe we will be the winners.&nbsp;

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:25.840
So we were watching this live during a stream&nbsp;
yesterday, and Joe Biden actually says,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:30.720
I believe we will have the votes to&nbsp;
win, but I am not declaring victory.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:36.320
There was plenty of reporting that was saying he&nbsp;
did declare victory there, including this whopper&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:42.320
of a headline from the BBC. The BBC tweeted, Trump&nbsp;
and Biden each claimed victory as lawsuits brew.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:48.000
Biden literally said, I'm not declaring&nbsp;
victory, what could Biden have said beyond&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:53.200
I am not claiming victory to make that more&nbsp;
clear. Biden issued this completely generic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:58.880
We believe we will prevail when all the votes are&nbsp;
counted. Everybody says that. And the BBC says,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:03.200
well, it's just like Trump claiming victory.&nbsp;
No, Trump actually went out at 2:00 a.m. Eastern&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.800
Time on election night and said, we've won. Trump&nbsp;
tweeted and Eric Trump tweeted and Rudy Giuliani&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:14.320
tweeted, We've won Pennsylvania when they had not&nbsp;
won it at that point in time. And yet he still Joe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:19.760
Biden can't get away from these false headlines&nbsp;
that say, hey, they've both claimed victory.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:24.080
No, they have not. And remember Donald Trump?&nbsp;
We looked at this tweet in the earlier segment.&nbsp;

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:30.640
Trump tweeted yesterday, We have claimed the&nbsp;
Commonwealth of Pennsylvania, the state of Georgia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:36.080
and the state of North Carolina, and we hereby&nbsp;
claim the state of Michigan if, in fact, there was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:42.960
a large number of secretly dumped ballots, as has&nbsp;
been widely reported. In any case, we already have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:48.960
to be careful about false reporting, about what&nbsp;
Joe Biden is saying and what Joe Biden is doing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:55.920
But what a contrast between how Joe Biden spent&nbsp;
the last 24 hours and how Donald Trump did. Donald&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:01.840
Trump spent the day filing lawsuits, which we will&nbsp;
talk about sending Eric Trump and Rudy Giuliani to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:06.720
Pennsylvania to claim everything is fraudulent,&nbsp;
tweeting that he's claiming states that he hasn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:12.400
actually won and saying in some cases the ballots&nbsp;
need to stop being counted and in other cases,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:18.400
the ballots need to start being counted in order&nbsp;
to justify his continued path to 270. Biden spoke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:23.600
for five minutes. Is allowing all votes to&nbsp;
happen, isn't telling anybody to stop counting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:29.600
reduced tensions and said if he has a&nbsp;
path to 270 that ultimately prevails,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:34.160
he will be everyone's president if he wins. You&nbsp;
don't have to agree with Joe Biden's policy on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:38.880
taxation. You don't have to believe that Joe&nbsp;
Biden is going to be the best on health care&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:46.240
to acknowledge that this reduction of the&nbsp;
temperature and a return to sanity is exactly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:54.000
what is needed at this time. And as a reminder,&nbsp;
again, record coronavirus cases yesterday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.720
a lot has been going on the last 48 hours. So&nbsp;
the coronavirus news has diminished. But there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:03.120
were one hundred and eight thousand cases in&nbsp;
the United States yesterday. This is the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:09.280
coronavirus cases in a single day since the&nbsp;
start of the pandemic, there were 100 deaths.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:14.640
And that number continues to climb as reports from&nbsp;
yesterday are finalized. We need to deal with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:20.080
pandemic. And when I see one guy tweeting,&nbsp;
stop counting here, start counting there.&nbsp;

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:25.280
I've one. I'm claiming Michigan, I'm claiming&nbsp;
Pennsylvania. And then I see the other guy say,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:31.360
I believe we have a path to victory. And if I get&nbsp;
it, I will be everyone's president because we are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:37.840
at unprecedentedly difficult times. It's very&nbsp;
clear which one we need right now. And I know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:42.000
that there are millions of&nbsp;
Republicans who recognize that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.560
Not all of them, not nearly all of them. But&nbsp;
there are millions of Republicans that recognize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:50.160
that that is what we need right now.
We'll have more about this on our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.400
Instagram page. Make sure you're following&nbsp;
us at The David Pakman Show on Instagram.&nbsp;

00:05:54.400 --> 00:06:46.480
And while you're there, follow&nbsp;
me on Instagram at David Pakman,

